Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,You mentioned bug
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.04,0:00:02.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,bounties.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.39,0:00:03.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,Maybe my hot take is
