Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.25,0:00:05.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,going to be dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.61,0:00:06.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,Because it's just so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.31,0:00:08.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,cheap now to run Strix
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.99,0:00:09.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,for example
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.79,0:00:12.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,out of the box on any
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.90,0:00:14.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,open source model in Red
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:15.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Team, whatever you want
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:15.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,to Red
